{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RetryPolicy"}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"RetryPolicy","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"externalID":"s:6Swidux11RetryPolicyV","role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/init(maxAttempts:baseDelay:maxDelay:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/baseDelay","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/maxAttempts","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/maxDelay"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/default","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/never"],"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/SQ","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" retries a flush whose save failed."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RetryPolicy"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forever"}]},{"type":"text","text":" matters just as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app can see rather than a silence."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/retrypolicy"]}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide":{"role":"article","title":"Persistence Middleware","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/persistencemiddlewareguide","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure automatic persistence that drains entity changes and batches database writes."}],"type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/RetryPolicy":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/retrypolicy","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"How ","type":"text"},{"id